cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PitchComet in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PitchComet: computed pitch decks and strategy reports for IT products"
version: 0.1b0
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "The PitchComet contributors"
abstract: >-
  An agent skill and Python toolkit that turns a short description of an IT product into an
  editable pitch deck (.pptx) and strategy report (.docx) with computed market sizing
  (TAM/SAM/SOM), growth, pricing, unit economics, a five-year financial model and valuation.
  Every figure is either sourced with a link or a labelled estimate with its formula. Native
  charts, a plain-language glossary, a QA gate and six locales (ru, en, zh, vi, id, ms).
keywords:
  - pitch deck
  - market sizing
  - financial model
  - unit economics
  - python-pptx
  - python-docx
  - agent skill
  - model context protocol
